# Normalise line endings. The repository stores LF and checks out LF on every
# platform, so a Windows checkout no longer rewrites whole files on commit.
* text=auto eol=lf

# The licence document is redistributed exactly as received, byte for byte.
LICENSE -text

# Files that must never be touched by the text filters.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.zip binary
